leads.desc:
We are looking for native German speakers that were born & raised in Germany to join a pair AI voice recording project. You can join with your friend, partner, family, colleague. Don’t worry, if you don’t have a partner, we will match you up.

Project Details:
• Have a natural conversation in German;
• 5 topics conversation, each topic 30 mins. Plus 10-20 mins for data check of the first topic;
• Voice only, camera off.

Payment Details:
• We will pay $100 for a pair, means $50 each person;
• Paid 30% after the submission, the rest will paid once data qualified.

Requirements
• Quiet Environment;
• Two devices each person, one laptop to connect with your partner & one handphone for record your own voice;
• Headphone, headset or earphone to connect with zoom. Prevent echo;
• Certain app that will be used for the phone recording.

Notes:
• Full payment is provided for approved recordings only;
• Re-recording may be required if quality standards are not met.

Limited slots available — contact us to reserve your spot.
